#: data/maps/RustboroCity_House3/scripts.inc:23
msgctxt "RustboroCity_House3_Text_IGivePerfectlySuitedNicknames"
msgid ""
"For my own POKéMON, I give them\n"
"perfectly suited nicknames!\p"
"It's my expression of, uh…\n"
"originality, yes, that's it!$"
msgstr ""
"我会给我自己的宝可梦\n"
"取最合适的昵称！\p"
"这就是我的，呃……\n"
"独创性的表现，没错，就是这样！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_House3/scripts.inc:29
msgctxt "RustboroCity_House3_Text_NamingPikachuPekachu"
msgid ""
"But giving the name PEKACHU to\n"
"a PIKACHU? It seems pointless.\p"
"I suppose it is good to use a name\n"
"that's easy to understand, but…$"
msgstr ""
"可是给皮卡丘取名叫皮咔丘？\n"
"好像没什么意义吧。\p"
"我想取个好懂的名字\n"
"也不错啦，可是……$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_House3/scripts.inc:35
msgctxt "RustboroCity_House3_Text_Pekachu"
msgid "PEKACHU: Peka!$"
msgstr "皮咔丘：皮咔！$"
